1
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:10,719
Hello, where are you?
I'm in your room right now.

2
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:12,931
You're in my room?

3
00:00:12,931 --> 00:00:17,912
Yeah. Why didn't you tell me
you brought that kid over?

4
00:00:18,113 --> 00:00:23,312
It was a coincidence, damn it.
And what were you doing in my room?

5
00:00:23,312 --> 00:00:24,787
I came to see you.

6
00:00:25,408 --> 00:00:28,960
That makes sense—
your staff said you came here.

7
00:00:29,883 --> 00:00:34,707
Yeah. I went to your shop but didn't see you.
They said you came back here,

8
00:00:34,707 --> 00:00:40,359
so I rushed back
and ran into Earth. Must've missed each other.

9
00:00:40,879 --> 00:00:46,719
Yeah… So what's going on
with you and that kid?

10
00:00:46,719 --> 00:00:49,270
Kid? What kid?

11
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:51,639
Your little brother, obviously.

12
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:57,640
Why would anything be going on?
He said he was staying at his friend's place.

13
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:01,630
Fine, fine.
That's all. I'm working.

14
00:01:01,630 --> 00:01:04,879
Yeah, okay.

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,759
You're in someone else's room—
at least dress properly.

16
00:01:21,759 --> 00:01:26,720
It's just the two of us. Why dress up?

17
00:01:27,119 --> 00:01:31,680
- Can we go now?
- Go where?

18
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:35,013
Back home.

19
00:01:35,013 --> 00:01:37,321
But… but I…

20
00:01:37,657 --> 00:01:41,016
What? Why're you talking like you're scared?

21
00:01:43,165 --> 00:01:45,788
Nothing…

22
00:01:45,788 --> 00:01:49,493
You're taking me to Tawan's, right?

23
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:52,319
Yeah.

24
00:01:56,960 --> 00:02:01,920
Ow— hey!
You said you'd take me to Tawan's!

25
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:04,237
Shut up. You're annoying me.

26
00:02:04,237 --> 00:02:07,039
What's your problem now?
